     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">This looks like fun if you&#39;re going to be anywhere near<div>Boston next week:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463101777000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RnHtTvUXR38JLLhQnmwU5\">http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/</a></div><div><br></div><div>They even have room for another short talk.  </div><div><br></div><div>Dustin&#39;s great --- he and Alp just polished off a new adaptation</div><div>scheme for variational inference that should be landing in </div><div>RStan and PyStan soon.  I didn&#39;t see any info on the other talks,</div><div>but what could be better than a holiday Stan surprise?</div><div><br></div><div>- Bob<br><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>Begin forwarded message:</div><br><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>From: </b></span><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Lizzie &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@meetup.com</a>&gt;<br></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>Subject: </b></span><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><b>[Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville] Next meetup a week from today</b><br></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>Date: </b></span><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif\">November 24, 2015 at 8:51:47 PM EST<br></span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>To: </b></span><span style=\"font-family:-webkit-system-font,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Stan-Users-Boston-C...@meetup.com</a><br></span></div><br><div><div><div><font face=\"verdana,arial,sans-serif\"><p>Just a reminder that the next Stan meetup is next Tuesday, December 1, at 6pm. Same place as last time.</p><p>Dustin Tran will give a talk on using Stan for variational inference, then we&#39;ll have a couple lightening (5 minute-ish) talks on projects. David Sparks will talk, I will talk about some of my work (there&#39;s time for another short talk, if you are interested just let me know). </p><p>Happy Thanksgiving this week to everyone and hope to see you all next week.</p><p>Lizzie</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n--<br>\r\nThis message was sent by Meetup on behalf of <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/members/14239247/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/members/14239247/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463101777000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kUuw_leEroWjfFPbQlhha\">Lizzie</a> from <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463101777000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RnHtTvUXR38JLLhQnmwU5\">Stan Users - Boston/Camberville</a>.\r\n<br>\r\n\t\t\tIf you want to reply to Lizzie, <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Stan-Users-Boston-Camberville/suggestion/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"ht